2026-09-30T09:33:14.0619222Z # PASS the kit covers the fifteen building kinds roadmap section G names
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0619374Z # PASS every kind builds sound geometry at all three LODs
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0619624Z # PASS every kind, at every frontage and storey count it offers, lands inside the section 4 budget
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0619787Z # PASS curved surfaces are smooth shaded, and flat ones are not
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0619964Z # PASS a pitched roof is laid in courses, not drawn as one grey sheet
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0620136Z # PASS a window is a hole in the wall, not a pane buried behind one
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0620294Z # PASS a back addition is behind the house, not in its front garden
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0620471Z # PASS the map LOD is the same building seen small, not a different one
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0620662Z # PASS every district assembles a populated block inside the scene budget
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0620859Z # PASS the budgets hold at every tile size the API accepts, not only the default one
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0621066Z # PASS a block is assembled from shared building meshes, not from unique buildings
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0621263Z # PASS lots tile the block without overlapping each other or leaving the tile
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0621432Z # PASS the card and the map lay the same town out as the close view does
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0621597Z # PASS what is drawn stays on its own lot and out of its neighbour
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0621795Z # PASS a baked variant reports the footprint it drew, not the one it was asked for
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0621997Z # PASS the same block id builds the same town, in this process and in a fresh load
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0622160Z # PASS a second node process builds the same town, byte for byte
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0622316Z # PASS two different block ids really do build different towns
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0622571Z # PASS variety comes from a hash of the id and the lot, with no clock and no entropy source in the file
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0623006Z # PASS art claims stay inside roadmap section 3 — original, representative, and granting nothing
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0623253Z # PASS unknown kinds and junk options fail cleanly instead of inventing a building
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0623372Z # PASS options are read, never written
2026-09-30T09:33:14.0623660Z # PASS the browser global exports the same contract with no module system present
